instead you have (very) old SNP annotation files, which are not used
anymore within the Aroma Project, cf

http://www.mail-archive.com/aroma-af...@googlegroups.com/msg01456.html <http://www.mail-archive.com/aroma-affymetrix@googlegroups.com/msg01456.html>

